	(text "Note about 5V Power:\n- When USB is connected this will be 5V from VBUS\n- When running from a battery this will be Vbatt-V_protection_diode\n- Battery can only charge when USB is connected and power switch is 'ON'\nNotes about GPIOs:\n- ADC: GPIO0 to 6 are available as ADC0 to 6\n- USB D+/- are GPIO12, 13.  JUST DON\"T USE THEM!\n- Boot is GPIO9.  Will share with onboard button.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
